Use Dovecot LDA (dovecot-lda) for local mail delivery instead of procmail.

procmail is deprecated and obsoleted by the dovecot package in Photon. The
Linux ostype default local mailer is switched from procmail to Dovecot's
local delivery agent, keeping the same mailer flags so delivery behavior is
unchanged.

diff -up a/cf/ostype/linux.m4 b/cf/ostype/linux.m4
--- a/cf/ostype/linux.m4
+++ b/cf/ostype/linux.m4
@@ -15,6 +15,7 @@ divert(-1)
 divert(0)
 VERSIONID(`$Id: linux.m4,v 8.14 2013-11-22 20:51:15 ca Exp $')
 define(`confEBINDIR', `/usr/sbin')
-ifdef(`PROCMAIL_MAILER_PATH',,
-	define(`PROCMAIL_MAILER_PATH', `/usr/bin/procmail'))
-FEATURE(local_procmail)
+dnl Use Dovecot LDA for local delivery instead of procmail
+define(`LOCAL_MAILER_PATH', `/usr/libexec/dovecot/dovecot-lda')dnl
+define(`LOCAL_MAILER_ARGS', `dovecot-lda -d $u')dnl
+define(`LOCAL_MAILER_FLAGS', `SPfhn9')dnl
